    "detailed_description": "<i><br>This game was created as part of BYKING Inc. newcomer training program.<br>Depending on your PC environment, the game may not run properly.<br>Also, unforeseen problems may occur during the game.<br>Please be aware of this.</i><br><br>*Although it is a local play-only title, it is possible to play online by using Steam Remote Play Together.<br>*Requires 3 controllers<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">About the game</h2>\u201cRunOut&quot; is a 3-player action game in which you control unique robots to blow your opponents into a hole!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Exhilaration of attack</h2>Exhilaration due to the sound and direction released when an attack hits!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2103390/extras/7e0886d814e99e07a4e074852b094ab9.poster.avif?t=1743409134\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2103390/extras/7e0886d814e99e07a4e074852b094ab9.webm?t=1743409134\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2103390/extras/7e0886d814e99e07a4e074852b094ab9.mp4?t=1743409134\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Simple operation</h2>Simple operation with only move, attack and stun bullets.<br>Even action newbies can enjoy it.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2103390/extras/e34b6bd138810e7eb5e949e3ee2ded0d.poster.avif?t=1743409134\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2103390/extras/e34b6bd138810e7eb5e949e3ee2ded0d.webm?t=1743409134\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2103390/extras/e34b6bd138810e7eb5e949e3ee2ded0d.mp4?t=1743409134\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Flexible character selection</h2>In the character select, as in practice, you can choose while moving the character!<br>Even if you are playing for the first time, you will have a perfect grasp of how to fight. Start the match with your favorite character.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2103390/extras/9510f73723f42ecc07548223e6fb820d.poster.avif?t=1743409134\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2103390/extras/9510f73723f42ecc07548223e6fb820d.webm?t=1743409134\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2103390/extras/9510f73723f42ecc07548223e6fb820d.mp4?t=1743409134\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Robots with a lot of unique characteristics.</h2><br><strong>Power Type</strong><br>Rush to keep hitting opponents with his big arm!<br>Stun the opponent, adjust the angle and blow him away!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2103390/extras/36929b44c7479c970e2b4c431fdc119a.poster.avif?t=1743409134\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2103390/extras/36929b44c7479c970e2b4c431fdc119a.webm?t=1743409134\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2103390/extras/36929b44c7479c970e2b4c431fdc119a.mp4?t=1743409134\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Speed type</strong><br>High-speed slash attack from a small body<br>Dodge their stun bullets with agility and cut them down at a moment's notice!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2103390/extras/2cf4b65b7f36047f6a8c8ac7df0cc685.poster.avif?t=1743409134\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2103390/extras/2cf4b65b7f36047f6a8c8ac7df0cc685.webm?t=1743409134\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2103390/extras/2cf4b65b7f36047f6a8c8ac7df0cc685.mp4?t=1743409134\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Tank type</strong><br>From his huge, tank-like body, he swings his hammer down and attacks a wide area!<br>Build up your strength and blow away two opponents at the same time with a full-bodied blow!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2103390/extras/f06a94ce99f44aef55ba3dac3bc497f8.poster.avif?t=1743409134\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2103390/extras/f06a94ce99f44aef55ba3dac3bc497f8.webm?t=1743409134\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2103390/extras/f06a94ce99f44aef55ba3dac3bc497f8.mp4?t=1743409134\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
